{"id":"e377ded121049df93b37d249c3e069d85b4e3a81","axis":"silent","repo":"envoyproxy/envoy","sha":"e377ded121049df93b37d249c3e069d85b4e3a81","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"changelogs/current/new_features/dynamic_modules__bootstrap-filter-chain-config-writer.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,12 @@","+Added a filter chain config writer to the dynamic module bootstrap extension. It writes the filter","+chains that the listeners with ``fcds_config`` find by name. Once a module calls","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_enable_filter_chain_config_writer``, it can add,","+update and remove filter chains with","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_add_or_update`` and","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_remove``, and","+``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done`` reports when","+each write becomes active or why it failed. The Rust SDK exposes these as","+``enable_filter_chain_config_writer``, ``filter_chain_config_writer_add_or_update`` and","+``filter_chain_config_writer_remove`` of ``EnvoyBootstrapExtensionConfig`` and","+``on_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done`` of ``BootstrapExtensionConfig``. See :ref:`Filter","+Chain Config Writer <config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_filter_chain_config_writer>`."],"additions":12,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/other_features/bootstrap_extensions/dynamic_modules.rst","lines":["@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@ This can be used to implement:"," "," * Server initialization logic when Envoy starts."," * Code that runs on every worker thread.","-* Clusters and listeners that the module adds, updates and removes.","+* Clusters, listeners and filter chains that the module adds, updates and removes."," * Reactions to runtime value changes."," * Singleton patterns for configuration loading from external services."," * Global state management across filters.","@@ -62,9 +62,9 @@ A module calls ``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_run_on_all_wo"," main thread to run its ``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_worker_event`` hook on every"," worker thread. Once every worker ran the event,"," ``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_run_on_all_workers_done`` runs on the main thread. A","-worker runs the event after it applied the cluster, host and listener changes that Envoy posted to","-it before the call, so the done hook tells the module that every worker can use them. Host health,","-weight and metadata changes that a cluster merges over its :ref:`update_merge_window","+worker runs the event after it applied the cluster, host, listener and filter chain changes that","+Envoy posted to it before the call, so the done hook tells the module that the workers can use them.","+Host health, weight and metadata changes that a cluster merges over its :ref:`update_merge_window"," <envoy_v3_api_field_config.cluster.v3.Cluster.CommonLbConfig.update_merge_window>` can reach the"," workers later."," ","@@ -215,6 +215,54 @@ prefix, tagged with ``config_name`` set to the extension name, or ``default`` if","   listeners_owned, Gauge, Listeners that the module owns","   updates_pending, Gauge, Writes that are queued or warming or that wait for the workers to start"," ","+.. _config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_filter_chain_config_writer:","+","+Filter Chain Config Writer","+--------------------------","+","+Once the module calls","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_enable_filter_chain_config_writer``, it can add,","+update and remove the filter chains that the listeners with ``fcds_config`` find by name, as the","+Filter Chain Discovery Service (FCDS) would deliver them. It passes a serialized :ref:`FilterChain","+<envoy_v3_api_msg_config.listener.v3.FilterChain>` to","+``envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_add_or_update``, and","+Envoy reports the outcome of each write through","+``envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done``. A write is","+active once the filter chain finished warming and Envoy posted it to the workers. A listener whose","+``fcds_config`` has no ``config_source`` waits, without a timeout, until the filter chains that it","+finds by name are written and finished warming, so the module can write a listener before its filter","+chains. Such a listener that Envoy creates before it starts its workers holds back the","+initialization of Envoy until then. A name is either discovered through FCDS or written by an","+extension. Envoy rejects a listener that requests a name of the other kind, and a write of a name","+that a listener requests through FCDS completes as ``Failed``. A listener keeps its names until it","+is removed and has finished draining. Envoy does not notice when another extension writes or removes","+the same filter chain, so the module must only write filter chains that no other extension writes.","+","+A written filter chain has the same authority as a filter chain delivered by FCDS, so build filter","+chains from a schema that the module owns. A write that changes a filter chain drains the","+connections of its previous version on the listeners that use it, and a removal drains all its","+connections and ends the wait of the listeners that wait for it. The config dump does not list","+written filter chains. Envoy does not time out a write that never finishes warming, or a listener","+that waits for a filter chain that is never written, so a module that waits for either should bound","+that wait itself.","+","+The filter chain config writer emits the following statistics with the","+``dynamic_modules.filter_chain_config_writer.`` prefix, tagged with ``config_name`` set to the","+extension name, or ``default`` if it is empty.","+","+.. csv-table::","+  :header: Name, Type, Description","+  :widths: 1, 1, 2","+","+  update_submitted, Counter, Writes that Envoy accepted","+  update_rejected, Counter, Writes that Envoy refused before the server was initialized or after shutdown began","+  update_active, Counter, Writes that became active","+  update_superseded, Counter, Writes that a later write replaced before they became active","+  update_removed, Counter, Writes that a removal ended before they became active","+  update_failed, Counter, Writes that failed when Envoy applied them","+  filter_chains_owned, Gauge, Filter chains that the module owns","+  updates_pending, Gauge, Writes that are queued or warming","+"," .. _config_bootstrap_extensions_dynamic_modules_ecds:"," "," ECDS Configuration"],"additions":52,"deletions":4,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/BUILD","lines":["@@ -44,6 +44,24 @@ envoy_cc_library(","     ],"," )"," ","+envoy_cc_library(","+    name = \"filter_chain_config_writer_lib\",","+    srcs = [\"filter_chain_config_writer.cc\"],","+    hdrs = [\"filter_chain_config_writer.h\"],","+    deps = [","+        \":resource_writer_lib\",","+        \"//envoy/init:manager_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/server:factory_context_interface\",","+        \"//envoy/server:listener_manager_interface\",","+        \"//source/common/common:fmt_lib\",","+        \"//source/common/init:target_lib\",","+        \"//source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/status\",","+        \"@abseil-cpp//absl/strings\",","+        \"@envoy_api//envoy/config/listener/v3:pkg_cc_proto\",","+    ],","+)","+"," envoy_cc_library(","     name = \"listener_writer_lib\",","     srcs = [\"listener_writer.cc\"],","@@ -72,6 +90,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","     deps = [","         \":writer_shared_state_lib\",","         \"//envoy/common:exception_lib\",","+        \"//envoy/common:optref_lib\",","         \"//envoy/common:pure_lib\",","         \"//envoy/common:time_interface\",","         \"//envoy/event:schedulable_cb_interface\",","@@ -151,6 +170,7 @@ envoy_cc_library(","         \":cluster_writer_lib\",","         \":config_snapshot_lib\",","         \":extension_config_subscription_lib\",","+        \":filter_chain_config_writer_lib\",","         \":listener_writer_lib\",","         \"//envoy/common:optref_lib\",","         \"//envoy/event:dispatcher_interface\","],"additions":20,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/abi_impl.cc","lines":["@@ -23,6 +23,7 @@ using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtens"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfigScheduler;"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionTimer;"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleClusterWriter;","+using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter;"," using Envoy::Extensions::Bootstrap::DynamicModules::DynamicModuleListenerWriter;"," using Envoy::Extensions::DynamicModules::MetricRegistry;"," ","@@ -955,4 +956,55 @@ envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_remove(","   return listener_writer->removeListener({listener_name.ptr, listener_name.length});"," }"," ","+// -------------------- Filter Chain Config Writer Callbacks --------------------","+","+bool envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_enable_filter_chain_config_writer(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr extension_config_envoy_ptr) {","+  if (!Envoy::Thread::MainThread::isMainOrTestThread()) {","+    IS_ENVOY_BUG(absl::StrCat(__func__, \" must be called on the main thread\"));","+    return false;","+  }","+  auto* config = static_cast<DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig*>(extension_config_envoy_ptr);","+  return config->enableFilterChainConfigWriter();","+}","+","+envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_result","+envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_add_or_update(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr extension_config_envoy_ptr,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer filter_chain_name,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer filter_chain, uint64_t* update_id_out) {","+  *update_id_out = 0;","+  if (!Envoy::Thread::MainThread::isMainOrTestThread()) {","+    IS_ENVOY_BUG(absl::StrCat(__func__, \" must be called on the main thread\"));","+    return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_result_NotAllowed;","+  }","+  auto* config = static_cast<DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig*>(extension_config_envoy_ptr);","+  DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter* filter_chain_config_writer =","+      config->filter_chain_config_writer_.get();","+  if (filter_chain_config_writer == nullptr) {","+    return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_result_NotAllowed;","+  }","+  return filter_chain_config_writer->addOrUpdateFilterChain(","+      {filter_chain_name.ptr, filter_chain_name.length}, {filter_chain.ptr, filter_chain.length},","+      *update_id_out);","+}","+","+envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_removal_result","+envoy_dynamic_module_callback_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_remove(","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_extension_config_envoy_ptr extension_config_envoy_ptr,","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_module_buffer filter_chain_name) {","+  if (!Envoy::Thread::MainThread::isMainOrTestThread()) {","+    IS_ENVOY_BUG(absl::StrCat(__func__, \" must be called on the main thread\"));","+    return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_removal_result_NotAllowed;","+  }","+  auto* config = static_cast<DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig*>(extension_config_envoy_ptr);","+  DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter* filter_chain_config_writer =","+      config->filter_chain_config_writer_.get();","+  if (filter_chain_config_writer == nullptr) {","+    return envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_removal_result_NotAllowed;","+  }","+  return filter_chain_config_writer->removeFilterChain(","+      {filter_chain_name.ptr, filter_chain_name.length});","+}","+"," } // extern \"C\""],"additions":52,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/cluster_writer.cc","lines":["@@ -211,7 +211,7 @@ void DynamicModuleClusterWriter::loseOwnership(absl::string_view cluster_name,","                                                absl::string_view error_details) {","   ENVOY_LOG(warn, \"dynamic module cluster writer {} no longer owns cluster {}: {}\", config_name_,","             cluster_name, error_details);","-  stats_.ownership_lost_.inc();","+  stats_.ownership_lost_->inc();","   completeWarmingUpdate(cluster_name, state, WriteOutcome::OwnershipLost, error_details);","   setOwned(state, false);","   eraseIfUnused(cluster_name);"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.cc","lines":["@@ -423,6 +423,30 @@ bool DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::enableListenerWriter() {","   return true;"," }"," ","+bool DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::enableFilterChainConfigWriter() {","+  if (filter_chain_config_writer_ != nullptr || shutdown_started_) {","+    return false;","+  }","+  DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::UpdateDoneCallback update_done;","+  if (on_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done_ != nullptr) {","+    update_done =","+        [this](uint64_t update_id, absl::string_view filter_chain_name,","+               envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_status status,","+               absl::string_view error_details) {","+          on_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done_(","+              thisAsVoidPtr(), in_module_config_, update_id,","+              {filter_chain_name.data(), filter_chain_name.size()}, status,","+              {error_details.data(), error_details.size()});","+        };","+  }","+  filter_chain_config_writer_ = std::make_unique<DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter>(","+      extension_name_, context_, std::move(update_done));","+  if (listener_manager_ != nullptr) {","+    filter_chain_config_writer_->onServerInitialized(*listener_manager_);","+  }","+  return true;","+}","+"," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onPostInit() {","   if (listener_writer_ != nullptr) {","     listener_writer_->onPostInit();","@@ -438,6 +462,9 @@ void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onShutdown() {","   if (listener_writer_ != nullptr) {","     listener_writer_->onShutdown();","   }","+  if (filter_chain_config_writer_ != nullptr) {","+    filter_chain_config_writer_->onShutdown();","+  }"," }"," "," void DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig::onExtensionDestroyed() {","@@ -731,6 +758,14 @@ newDynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig(","           \"envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done\");","   config->on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done_ =","       on_listener_writer_update_done.ok() ? on_listener_writer_update_done.value() : nullptr;","+  auto on_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done =","+      config->dynamic_module_","+          ->getFunctionPointer<OnBootstrapExtensionFilterChainConfigWriterUpdateDoneType>(","+              \"envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done\");","+  config->on_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done_ =","+      on_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done.ok()","+          ? on_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done.value()","+          : nullptr;","   auto on_runtime_bool_update =","       config->dynamic_module_->getFunctionPointer<OnBootstrapExtensionRuntimeBoolUpdateType>(","           \"envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_runtime_bool_update\");"],"additions":35,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config.h","lines":["@@ -20,6 +20,7 @@"," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/cluster_writer.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/config_snapshot.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/extension_config_subscription.h\"","+#include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/filter_chain_config_writer.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/listener_writer.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi/abi.h\""," #include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/dynamic_modules.h\"","@@ -76,6 +77,8 @@ using OnBootstrapExtensionClusterWriterUpdateDoneType =","     decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_writer_update_done);"," using OnBootstrapExtensionListenerWriterUpdateDoneType =","     decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done);","+using OnBootstrapExtensionFilterChainConfigWriterUpdateDoneType =","+    decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done);"," using OnBootstrapExtensionEcdsUpdateType =","     decltype(&envoy_dynamic_module_on_bootstrap_extension_ecds_update);"," using OnBootstrapExtensionRuntimeBoolUpdateType =","@@ -196,6 +199,9 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","     if (listener_writer_ != nullptr) {","       listener_writer_->onServerInitialized(listener_manager);","     }","+    if (filter_chain_config_writer_ != nullptr) {","+      filter_chain_config_writer_->onServerInitialized(listener_manager);","+    }","   }"," ","   /**","@@ -257,6 +263,13 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","    */","   bool enableListenerWriter();"," ","+  /**","+   * Creates the filter chain config writer, which lets the module add, update and remove filter","+   * chains. Must be called on the main thread.","+   * @return false if the filter chain config writer already exists or shutdown began.","+   */","+  bool enableFilterChainConfigWriter();","+","   /**","    * Called on the main thread once Envoy finished initializing, right before it starts its","    * workers.","@@ -320,6 +333,8 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","       on_bootstrap_extension_cluster_writer_update_done_ = nullptr;","   OnBootstrapExtensionListenerWriterUpdateDoneType","       on_bootstrap_extension_listener_writer_update_done_ = nullptr;","+  OnBootstrapExtensionFilterChainConfigWriterUpdateDoneType","+      on_bootstrap_extension_filter_chain_config_writer_update_done_ = nullptr;","   OnBootstrapExtensionRuntimeBoolUpdateType on_bootstrap_extension_runtime_bool_update_ = nullptr;","   OnBootstrapExtensionRuntimeIntUpdateType on_bootstrap_extension_runtime_int_update_ = nullptr;","   OnBootstrapExtensionRuntimeNumberUpdateType on_bootstrap_extension_runtime_number_update_ =","@@ -374,6 +389,8 @@ class DynamicModuleBootstrapExtensionConfig","   DynamicModuleClusterWriterPtr cluster_writer_;","   // The listener writer, or nullptr until the module enables it.","   DynamicModuleListenerWriterPtr listener_writer_;","+  // The filter chain config writer, or nullptr until the module enables it.","+  DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriterPtr filter_chain_config_writer_;"," "," private:","   /**"],"additions":17,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/filter_chain_config_writer.cc","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,168 @@","+#include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/filter_chain_config_writer.h\"","+","+#include <chrono>","+#include <utility>","+","+#include \"envoy/config/listener/v3/listener_components.pb.validate.h\"","+#include \"envoy/init/manager.h\"","+","+#include \"source/common/common/fmt.h\"","+","+#include \"absl/strings/str_cat.h\"","+","+namespace Envoy {","+namespace Extensions {","+namespace Bootstrap {","+namespace DynamicModules {","+","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(WriteOutcome::Active) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_status_Active);","+static_assert(","+    static_cast<int>(WriteOutcome::Superseded) ==","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_status_Superseded);","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(WriteOutcome::Removed) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_status_Removed);","+static_assert(static_cast<int>(WriteOutcome::Failed) ==","+              envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_status_Failed);","+static_assert(","+    static_cast<int>(RemovalResult::Success) ==","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_removal_result_Success);","+static_assert(","+    static_cast<int>(RemovalResult::NotAllowed) ==","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_removal_result_NotAllowed);","+static_assert(","+    static_cast<int>(RemovalResult::NotFound) ==","+    envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_removal_result_NotFound);","+","+DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter(","+    absl::string_view extension_name, Server::Configuration::ServerFactoryContext& context,","+    UpdateDoneCallback update_done)","+    : ResourceWriter(extension_name, context, std::move(update_done),","+                     {\"filter_chain_config_writer\", \"filter_chains_owned\",","+                      /*notices_ownership_loss=*/false},","+                     /*resource_type_url=*/\"\"),","+      init_target_(","+          absl::StrCat(\"dynamic_modules_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer:\", config_name_),","+          [this]() {","+            onClustersInitialized();","+            init_target_.ready();","+          }) {}","+","+void DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::onServerInitialized(","+    Server::ListenerManager& listener_manager) {","+  listener_manager_ = &listener_manager;","+  server_initialized_ = true;","+  // The server init manager starts once Envoy initialized its static and CDS clusters, which the","+  // routes of a filter chain can refer to.","+  if (context_.initManager().state() == Init::Manager::State::Uninitialized) {","+    context_.initManager().add(init_target_);","+  } else {","+    onClustersInitialized();","+  }","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::onClustersInitialized() {","+  // Only a running server starts its init manager, and it calls onShutdown() before it frees the","+  // listener manager.","+  if (!shut_down_) {","+    listener_update_callbacks_handle_ = listener_manager_->addListenerUpdateCallbacks(*this);","+  }","+  startApplying();","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::onShutdown() {","+  // The listener manager goes away before this writer does.","+  listener_update_callbacks_handle_.reset();","+  shutDown();","+}","+","+envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_result","+DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::addOrUpdateFilterChain(absl::string_view filter_chain_name,","+                                                             absl::string_view filter_chain,","+                                                             uint64_t& update_id) {","+  return queueWrite(filter_chain_name, filter_chain, /*version_info=*/\"\", update_id)","+             ? envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_result_Success","+             : envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_result_NotAllowed;","+}","+","+envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_removal_result","+DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::removeFilterChain(absl::string_view filter_chain_name) {","+  return static_cast<envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_removal_result>(","+      queueRemoval(filter_chain_name));","+}","+","+absl::Status DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::validateUpdate(","+    const WriterOperation& operation,","+    envoy::config::listener::v3::FilterChain& filter_chain) const {","+  if (operation.name.empty()) {","+    return absl::InvalidArgumentError(\"filter chain names must not be empty\");","+  }","+  return parseAndValidate(operation, \"filter chain\", filter_chain);","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::applyUpdate(WriterOperation& operation) {","+  WriterResourceState& state = states_.find(operation.name)->second;","+  envoy::config::listener::v3::FilterChain filter_chain;","+  if (absl::Status status = validateUpdate(operation, filter_chain); !status.ok()) {","+    ENVOY_LOG_PERIODIC(","+        warn, std::chrono::seconds(10),","+        \"dynamic module filter chain config writer {} rejected update {} of filter chain {}: {}\",","+        config_name_, operation.update_id, operation.name, status.message());","+    completeUpdate(operation.update_id, operation.name, WriteOutcome::Failed, status.message());","+    eraseIfUnused(operation.name);","+    return;","+  }","+","+  const absl::StatusOr<bool> update_or_error = applyWithManager(","+      operation.name, [&]() { return listener_manager_->addOrUpdateFilterChain(filter_chain); });","+","+  if (!update_or_error.ok()) {","+    ENVOY_LOG_PERIODIC(warn, std::chrono::seconds(10),","+                       \"dynamic module filter chain config writer {} failed to apply update {} of \"","+                       \"filter chain {}: {}\",","+                       config_name_, operation.update_id, operation.name,","+                       update_or_error.status().message());","+    // The listener manager keeps the warming and active versions of the filter chain. Only the","+    // error of an FCDS name conflict is free of the contents of the filter chain.","+    completeUpdate(","+        operation.update_id, operation.name, WriteOutcome::Failed,","+        absl::IsAlreadyExists(update_or_error.status())","+            ? std::string(update_or_error.status().message())","+            : fmt::format(\"the listener manager rejected filter chain {}\", operation.name));","+    eraseIfUnused(operation.name);","+    return;","+  }","+","+  setOwned(state, true);","+  // An unchanged write with nothing warming matches the active configuration.","+  if (!update_or_error.value() && state.warming_update_id == 0) {","+    completeUpdate(operation.update_id, operation.name, WriteOutcome::Active);","+    return;","+  }","+  // This write replaces the warming one, even when the listener manager found them identical.","+  completeWarmingUpdate(operation.name, state, WriteOutcome::Superseded);","+  state.warming_update_id = operation.update_id;","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::applyRemoval(const WriterOperation& operation) {","+  WriterResourceState& state = states_.find(operation.name)->second;","+  if (state.owned) {","+    setOwned(state, false);","+    completeWarmingUpdate(operation.name, state, WriteOutcome::Removed);","+    listener_manager_->removeFilterChain(operation.name);","+  }","+  eraseIfUnused(operation.name);","+}","+","+void DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter::onFilterChainAddOrUpdate(","+    absl::string_view filter_chain_name) {","+  auto it = states_.find(filter_chain_name);","+  if (it != states_.end()) {","+    completeWarmingUpdate(filter_chain_name, it->second, WriteOutcome::Active);","+  }","+}","+","+} // namespace DynamicModules","+} // namespace Bootstrap","+} // namespace Extensions","+} // namespace Envoy"],"additions":168,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/filter_chain_config_writer.h","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,94 @@","+#pragma once","+","+#include <cstdint>","+#include <memory>","+#include <string>","+","+#include \"envoy/config/listener/v3/listener_components.pb.h\"","+#include \"envoy/server/factory_context.h\"","+#include \"envoy/server/listener_manager.h\"","+","+#include \"source/common/init/target_impl.h\"","+#include \"source/extensions/bootstrap/dynamic_modules/resource_writer.h\"","+#include \"source/extensions/dynamic_modules/abi/abi.h\"","+","+#include \"absl/status/status.h\"","+#include \"absl/strings/string_view.h\"","+","+namespace Envoy {","+namespace Extensions {","+namespace Bootstrap {","+namespace DynamicModules {","+","+/**","+ * Adds, updates and removes the filter chains of a bootstrap dynamic module, which the listeners","+ * with fcds_config find by name. Writes are queued and applied on the main thread in later event","+ * loop iterations, and the outcome of every accepted write is reported through the done callback.","+ * All methods must be called on the main thread.","+ */","+class DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter","+    : public ResourceWriter<","+          WriterResourceState,","+          envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_status>,","+      public Server::ListenerUpdateCallbacks {","+public:","+  /**","+   * @param extension_name the name of the bootstrap extension.","+   * @param context the server factory context.","+   * @param update_done the callback that reports outcomes, or nullptr when the module has no done","+   * hook.","+   */","+  DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriter(absl::string_view extension_name,","+                                       Server::Configuration::ServerFactoryContext& context,","+                                       UpdateDoneCallback update_done);","+","+  /**","+   * Called once the server is initialized. Writes are not allowed before this.","+   */","+  void onServerInitialized(Server::ListenerManager& listener_manager);","+","+  /**","+   * Called when shutdown begins. Refuses later writes and drops the queued work.","+   */","+  void onShutdown();","+","+  /**","+   * Queues a write of the given serialized filter chain.","+   * @param update_id is set to the ID of the write, or to 0 when the write is rejected.","+   */","+  envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_update_result","+  addOrUpdateFilterChain(absl::string_view filter_chain_name, absl::string_view filter_chain,","+                         uint64_t& update_id);","+","+  /**","+   * Queues the removal of the given filter chain.","+   */","+  envoy_dynamic_module_type_bootstrap_filter_chain_config_writer_removal_result","+  removeFilterChain(absl::string_view filter_chain_name);","+","+  // Server::ListenerUpdateCallbacks","+  void onListenerAddOrUpdate(absl::string_view, const Network::ListenerConfig&) override {}","+  void onListenerRemoval(const std::string&) override {}","+  void onFilterChainAddOrUpdate(absl::string_view filter_chain_name) override;","+","+private:","+  // ResourceWriter","+  void applyUpdate(WriterOperation& operation) override;","+  void applyRemoval(const WriterOperation& operation) override;","+","+  void onClustersInitialized();","+  absl::Status validateUpdate(const WriterOperation& operation,","+                              envoy::config::listener::v3::FilterChain& filter_chain) const;","+","+  Server::ListenerManager* listener_manager_ = nullptr;","+  Init::TargetImpl init_target_;","+  Server::ListenerUpdateCallbacksHandlePtr listener_update_callbacks_handle_;","+};","+","+using DynamicModuleFilterChainConfigWriterPtr ="],"additions":88,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":445,"deletions":5,"truncated":true,"file_count":9},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:23:10.693923+00:00"}